cff-version: 1.2.0
title: first-bite
message: "If you reference this project in academic or technical work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "U.S. Federal Government"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/USAREUR-AF/first-bite"
url: "https://github.com/USAREUR-AF/first-bite"
keywords:
  - packet-capture
  - binary-protocol
  - decoder
  - data-dictionary
  - can-bus
  - zenoh
abstract: >-
  first-bite captures frames from a network interface or a capture file,
  decodes fixed-layout binary messages against a declarative dictionary, and
  publishes the decoded records. The message set is data, not code: a
  dictionary is a directory of JSON files.
